# Pop-on caption "HI" on row 15 (white), field 1, control-code doubling ON.
# Options: SerializeOptions{} (field 1 default). Whitespace and #-comments are
# ignored by the test reader; every other token is one hex byte.
#
# byte pair   masked      meaning
# 94 20       14 20       RCL  (Resume Caption Loading -> pop-on)   [doubled]
# 94 20       14 20       RCL  (second copy, collapsed on decode)
# 94 e0       14 60       PAC  row 15, white                       [doubled]
# 94 e0       14 60       PAC  (second copy)
# c8 49       48 49       chars 'H' 'I'
# 94 2f       14 2f       EOC  (End Of Caption -> flip)             [doubled]
# 94 2f       14 2f       EOC  (second copy)

94 20 94 20
94 e0 94 e0
c8 49
94 2f 94 2f
